## Explore Our Brands
We’re thrilled to introduce our powerful collection of brands, each entrenched as market leaders in their respective industries and backed by decades of proven quality, innovation, and customer commitment.
As a connected company, Balcan Innovations strives to deliver sustainable, high-quality film, flexible packaging, and reflective insulation that protect and promote our customers’ products​.
### Balcan Packaging
North America's trusted expert, manufacturing
high-quality technical films and flexible
packaging customized to your needs.
Visit Balcan Packaging
### Plastixx FFS Technologies
An innovative manufacturer of tubular FFS films and PE valve bags for the packaging of powdery and granular products.
Visit Plastixx
### NELMAR Security Packaging Systems
At the forefront of tamper-evident security packaging for 35+ years, protecting currency and assets in transit worldwide.
Visit NELMAR
### rFoil
An innovative manufacturer of high-quality reflective insulation and radiant barrier products for commercial and residential applications.
Visit rFoil
### Reflectix
An experienced leader in reflective insulation technology, manufacturing advanced energy barriers designed to reduce consumption.
Visit Reflectix
